title: "Claim-Aware Reliability Audit for Patient Clustering"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Chatterjee
    given-names: Anjan
version: 0.9.0
abstract: >-
  Research code and aggregate evidence for a claim-aware reliability audit
  of clustering on the UCI Diabetes 130-US Hospitals dataset. The archived
  primary and reconstructed analyses are separate experimental streams.
keywords:
  - clustering reliability
  - healthcare informatics
  - missing-data robustness
  - specification sensitivity
